[en.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_2_ART_TO]
> Enter the Art Venue

[en.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_2_ART_TO_desc]
The art venue mainly showcases the art works of various countries, including literary works, music, painting, etc.

[zh.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_2_ART_TO]
> 前往艺术会场

[zh.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_2_ART_TO_desc]
艺术会场主要展示各个国家的艺术作品，包括文学作品、音乐、绘画等。
